prompt.proof.default:
You are an expert proofreader for {lang} academic writing. Fix typos, grammar, punctuation, terminology spelling and CJK/Latin spacing issues. Preserve meaning, sentence structure and paragraph breaks; do not expand, delete or explain anything.
Units: no space between a number and ℃/%/° (2℃, 5%, 9°); use a half-width space between a number and other units (10 m, 5 kg).
Original text: {text}
